{"id":"b412d75e-0d74-466e-85f3-2ea137fb1cc7","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:25:13.233Z","batchId":"onboarding_step-3-7-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"step-3.7-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width: 640px;\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm center\">\n    <h1>Onboarding</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Set up your account in 3 quick steps</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Step Indicator -->\n  <div class=\"row between center\" id=\"stepIndicator\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm center step-item active\" data-step=\"1\">\n      <div class=\"step-circle\">1</div>\n      <span class=\"small\">Account</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hr\" style=\"flex: 1; margin: 0 1rem;\"></div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm center step-item\" data-step=\"2\">\n      <div class=\"step-circle\">2</div>\n      <span class=\"small\">Preferences</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hr\" style=\"flex: 1; margin: 0 1rem;\"></div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm center step-item\" data-step=\"3\">\n      <div class=\"step-circle\">3</div>\n      <span class=\"small\">Done</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Step 1: Account -->\n  <div class=\"card step-content\" id=\"step1\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Account Details</div>\n    <div class=\"card-desc\">Enter your basic account information to get started.</div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-md\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n      <label>\n        Full Name\n        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Jane Doe\" required>\n      </label>\n      <label>\n        Email Address\n        <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"jane@example.com\" required>\n      </label>\n      <label>\n        Password\n        <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"Create a strong password\" required>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Must be at least 8 characters with 1 number and 1 special character.</span>\n      </label>\n      <label>\n        Confirm Password\n        <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"Re-enter your password\" required>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Step 2: Preferences -->\n  <div class=\"card step-content hidden\" id=\"step2\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Your Preferences</div>\n    <div class=\"card-desc\">Customize your experience to match how you work.</div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-md\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n        Enable email notifications for account updates\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\">\n        Enable push notifications for new messages\n      </label>\n      <label>\n        Default Theme\n        <select>\n          <option>System Default</option>\n          <option>Light</option>\n          <option>Dark</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n      <label>\n        Language\n        <select>\n          <option>English (US)</option>\n          <option>Spanish</option>\n          <option>French</option>\n          <option>German</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n      <label>\n        Timezone\n        <select>\n          <option>Pacific Time (PT)</option>\n          <option>Mountain Time (MT)</option>\n          <option>Central Time (CT)</option>\n          <option>Eastern Time (ET)</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Step 3: Done -->\n  <div class=\"card step-content hidden\" id=\"step3\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-md center\" style=\"padding: 2rem 0;\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px; font-size: 2rem; background: var(--color-success, #10b981); color: white;\">✓</div>\n      <div class=\"card-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\">You're all set!</div>\n      <div class=\"card-desc\" style=\"text-align: center; max-width: 400px;\">Your account has been created and your preferences are saved. You can update these anytime in your settings.</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem; width: 100%;\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"muted\">Account Email</span>\n          <span>jane@example.com</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"muted\">Notifications</span>\n          <span>Email only</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"muted\">Default Theme</span>\n          <span>System Default</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Navigation Buttons -->\n  <div class=\"row between center\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem;\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"backBtn\" disabled>Back</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" id=\"nextBtn\">Next Step</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .step-circle {\n    width: 32px;\n    height: 32px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);\n    color: var(--color-muted, #6b7280);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.875rem;\n    transition: all 0.2s ease;\n  }\n  .step-item.active .step-circle {\n    background: var(--color-primary, #2563eb);\n    color: white;\n  }\n  .step-item.completed .step-circle {\n    background: var(--color-success, #10b981);\n    color: white;\n  }\n  .step-item.completed .step-circle::after {\n    content: \"✓\";\n  }\n  .step-item {\n    opacity: 0.6;\n  }\n  .step-item.active, .step-item.completed {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n  .hidden {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n  .step-content {\n    animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  @keyframes fadeIn {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  let currentStep = 1;\n  const totalSteps = 3;\n  const stepContents = document.querySelectorAll('.step-content');\n  const stepItems = document.querySelectorAll('.step-item');\n  const backBtn = document.getElementById('backBtn');\n  const nextBtn = document.getElementById('nextBtn');\n\n  function updateUI() {\n    stepContents.forEach((content, index) => {\n      content.classList.toggle('hidden', index + 1 !== currentStep);\n    });\n\n    stepItems.forEach((item, index) => {\n      item.classList.remove('active', 'completed');\n      if (index + 1 === currentStep) item.classList.add('active');\n      else if (index + 1 < currentStep) item.classList.add('completed');\n    });\n\n    if (currentStep === 1) {\n      backBtn.disabled = true;\n      nextBtn.textContent = 'Next Step';\n      backBtn.classList.remove('hidden');\n    } else if (currentStep === totalSteps) {\n      backBtn.classList.add('hidden');\n      nextBtn.textContent = 'Go to Dashboard';\n    } else {\n      backBtn.disabled = false;\n      backBtn.classList.remove('hidden');\n      nextBtn.textContent = 'Next Step';\n    }\n  }\n\n  nextBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    if (currentStep < totalSteps) {\n      currentStep++;\n      updateUI();\n    } else {\n      alert('Navigating to your dashboard...');\n    }\n  });\n\n  backBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    if (currentStep > 1) {\n      currentStep--;\n      updateUI();\n    }\n  });\n\n  updateUI();\n</script>","deltas":[[39877,"<div"],[39877," class=\"page stack"],[39936," gap-lg"],[39946,"\" style=\"max"],[39946,"-width: 640"],[39981,"px;\